WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.652
A real reply pauses for two approval questions.

00:00:07.652 --> 00:00:10.906
Answer the complete batch before resuming.

00:00:10.906 --> 00:00:17.572
Resume sends both answers and continues the same turn.

00:00:17.572 --> 00:00:19.208
Resume complete.

00:00:19.208 --> 00:00:25.504
A new turn gets a new approval batch.

00:00:25.504 --> 00:00:30.424
Read-only replay.

00:00:30.424 --> 00:00:32.800
Back live. Paused.
